# Copy to .env.test. Never commit .env.test — even though it should point
# at a disposable test schema, keep the same "never commit env files"
# habit. (.env.test is already in .gitignore.)
#
# Point this at the dedicated `limona_test` SCHEMA inside the same shared
# Supabase project Limona's real database uses (ref qafzhvccodchweeebovd) —
# never Jason's real database/schema. `npm run test:db` truncates tables
# between test files. Docker is no longer used anywhere in this ecosystem;
# see shared-db/migrations/0002_create_limona_test_schema.up.sql in the main
# repo for the full reasoning and how this schema + its login role were set
# up. Must be fully migrated before first use:
#   DATABASE_URL=... npm run migrate:up
#
# REQUIRED SAFETY RULE, enforced in code (test/support/testDb.ts): the
# connection string MUST contain "test" (case-insensitive). The connection
# below satisfies this via the "limona_test_app" role name, even though the
# database name itself is just Supabase's default "postgres" — the
# limona_test_app role's search_path is scoped server-side to the
# limona_test schema, so it can never reach real data even by mistake. This
# guard exists because a missing .env.test previously let `npm run test:db`
# silently fall through to the real production DATABASE_URL and truncate
# real data.
DATABASE_URL=postgres://limona_test_app.qafzhvccodchweeebovd:CHANGE_ME@aws-1-us-east-2.pooler.supabase.com:5432/postgres

# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is NOT needed here — test/db tests stub out the Anthropic
# API (see test/support/fakeAiProviders.ts) so it never makes real network
# calls or needs a real key. Embeddings run locally and never need a key.
SESSION_COOKIE_SECRET=test-secret-at-least-32-characters-long

# REQUIRED: without this, STORAGE_DIR defaults to "storage" (see
# src/config/env.ts) — the SAME folder the live production app serves
# uploaded documents from. Every npm run test:db run then writes fixture
# document/asset folders straight into production's real storage directory.
# Point this at a separate, gitignored directory used only by DB tests.
STORAGE_DIR=storage-test
